cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-Dabia2013
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the MAMUT-routing curation of the Dabia2013 TDVRPTW and TDVRP benchmark. Also cite the original benchmark: Solomon (1987) for the instance definitions, Dabia et al. (2013) for the time-dependent extension, Ichoua et al. (2003) for the travel-time model, and Lera-Romero et al. (2020) for the distributed raw sources. Record the exact Git commit used.
