url: "https://github.com/ANR-MAMUT/MAMUT-routing-Dabia2013"
abstract: >-
  This repository provides the MAMUT-routing curation of the classic Duration-Minimization TDVRPTW benchmark introduced by Dabia et al. (2013): Solomon (1987) instances with 25, 50 and 100 customers and IGP time-dependent travel times (Ichoua et al. 2003), as distributed with the open-source solver of Lera-Romero et al. (2020). A TDVRP variant holds the same instances with the time windows removed. The curation provides canonical instances, arrival-time-function sidecars and checker-validated best-known solutions. The original benchmark definitions belong to their authors, and the source attributions are documented in README.md.
